steps.change:
Change the createVertex override (lines 142-147) so the loader lambda calls `invalidateReads()` instead of `invalidateAll()`. This prevents the createVertexCache itself from being cleared inside the loader. Replace:

    override fun createVertex(label: String, properties: Map<String, Any?>): GraphVertex {
        val key = WriteVertexKey(label, properties.hashCode())
        return createVertexCache.get(key) {
            delegate.createVertex(label, properties).also { invalidateAll() }
        }!!
    }

With:

    override fun createVertex(label: String, properties: Map<String, Any?>): GraphVertex {
        val key = WriteVertexKey(label, properties.hashCode())
        return createVertexCache.get(key) {
            delegate.createVertex(label, properties).also { invalidateReads() }
        }!!
    }

